{"id":"n41847-4-8","stage":5,"title":"내던지다 · 献出","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41847-4-8-1","ko":"드라마 속 주인공들은 사랑을 위해서 자기 목숨까지 내던지던데.","zh":"电视剧里的主角们可是为了爱情甚至愿意牺牲自己的生命呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"드라마","meaning":"电视剧，连续剧","explanation":"드라마：电视剧，连续剧","readings":[{"term":"드라마","audio":"/audio/48196dde09d3559f1d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61389","senseId":"1","lemma":"드라마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속","meaning":"中，里","explanation":"속：中，里","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"6","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주인공들은","meaning":"主人公，主角","explanation":"주인공：主人公，主角；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주인공","audio":"/audio/4b72fe4264a8ed541f2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62472","senseId":"1","lemma":"주인공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사랑을","meaning":"爱，爱情，恋情","explanation":"사랑：爱，爱情，恋情；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사랑","audio":"/audio/ff2763f11c21f16783f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66649","senseId":"1","lemma":"사랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위해서","meaning":"为了","explanation":"위하다：为了；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"위하다","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29736","senseId":"1","lemma":"위하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자기","meaning":"自己","explanation":"자기：自己","readings":[{"term":"자기","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57311","senseId":"1","lemma":"자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목숨까지","meaning":"命，生命，性命","explanation":"목숨：命，生命，性命；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"목숨","audio":"/audio/3255b0b5500a0f947550.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16152","senseId":"1","lemma":"목숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내던지던데.","meaning":"献出","explanation":"내던지다：献出；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或